### SCR-013 - /bookings/[id]

```yaml id=SCR-013 kind=screen
route: /bookings/[id]
recipe: detail
purpose: Show everything about one booking and what can still be done with it
auth: authenticated
flow: FLW-005
data:
  - bind: API-getBooking(id)
