## 11. Flows

### FLW-001 - Find a service and book it

```yaml id=FLW-001 kind=flow
name: Find a service and book it
primary: true
screens: [SCR-004, SCR-005, SCR-006, SCR-009, SCR-010, SCR-011]
start: SCR-004
end: SCR-011
purpose: The main journey, from the home screen to a confirmed booking.
```

### FLW-002 - Sign in

```yaml id=FLW-002 kind=flow
name: Sign in
screens: [SCR-001, SCR-002, SCR-004]
start: SCR-001
end: SCR-004
```

### FLW-003 - Book with a specific provider

```yaml id=FLW-003 kind=flow
name: Book with a specific provider
screens: [SCR-005, SCR-006, SCR-007, SCR-008, SCR-009]
start: SCR-005
end: SCR-009
```

### FLW-004 - Set a reminder after booking

```yaml id=FLW-004 kind=flow
name: Set a reminder after booking
screens: [SCR-011, SCR-020]
start: SCR-011
end: SCR-020
```

### FLW-005 - Move a booking

```yaml id=FLW-005 kind=flow
